183	/****************************************************************************
184	 * Name: lcd_init_sequence
185	 *
186	 * Description:
187	 *   Full GC9D01 init sequence from ARMINO lcd_spi_gc9d01.c.
188	 *   If display_on is true, sends 0x29 (display on) at the end;
189	 *   otherwise leaves the display off so the caller can fill the
190	 *   framebuffer first (avoids flash of uninitialised GRAM).
